  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Learn Key Institute (LKI) has been helping students grow their skills and careers since 1995. All courses are accredited by internationally recognised bodies such as ACCA, OTHM, and Ofqual, so your qualifications are valued around the world.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At LKI, you’ll be part of a diverse and friendly learning community. Whether you’re studying in Malta, Italy, or Barcelona, you’ll find plenty of support to help you settle in. LKI also takes part in the Erasmus+ Programme, allowing you to study or train abroad.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>LKI offers a wide range of accommodation options, including homestays, student residences, hostels, and studio flats (shared and private). Most options are either single, twin or multi-bedded rooms, depending on the accommodation type.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
